      "field": "research.visa",
      "value": {
        "summary": "NEW: ResidencyMatch.ai explicitly states J-1 (ECFMG), H-1B, AND F-1 all supported -- first source confirming F-1/OPT (previously NOT_STATED), upgrading it to CONFIRMED. Aligns with official page's H-1B/J-1 claim and FREIDA's F-1 'yes'. But ResidencyAdvisor (separately queried) lists only J-1 and F-1, omitting H-1B -- continues the existing FREIDA-vs-official H-1B ambiguity. Net: F-1/OPT CONFIRMED; H-1B remains contested, leans LIKELY_YES."
      },
      "originalValue": {
